# FLINTHOLD: a foe that reaches the cave takes hearts by its kind (a redback
# 2, a shagtusk 10, Lord Jaw 30). At 0 the cave falls: try again or leave.
game flinthold
wait 5
cheat stage 1
cheat foe redback 0 390
waituntil foes == 0 200
expect cave == 28
cheat foe shagtusk 0 396
waituntil foes == 0 400
expect cave == 18
cheat foe jaw 0 396
waituntil phase == 3 400
expect cave == 0
waituntil state == 5 200
wait 70
press A
wait 2
expect state == 3
expect cave == 30
expect phase == 0
